-- ---- AOB Scans, for dynamic addresses ----
-- ISSUE: Impossible to set a scan range ?
-- Issue: AoB[0] Why [0]? - dah fuq is that? an index, the byte to start write at ?
--issue: sahould only need a word, 90 write to 1 byte, but 10% of the time this fails ?
-- Issue: need to prevent patching wrong address
--... can happen if player patches correct address saves game, and reboots the game and app
--app will detect the 30000000 address versions.
--[[
if
AoB_Already_Patched_1 = AOBScan("D4 90 70 00")
AoB_Already_Patched_2 = AOBScan("D4 90 90 90")
AoB_CORRECT_unpatched_result = AOBScan("D4 96 70 00 02 B5 6C AF")
AoB_Incorrect_unpatched_result = AOBScan("D4 96 70 00 99 A3 30 9F")
--]]
